# ==========================================================

# Raw data

#

# Raw sequencing files and proteomics input tables are kept

# locally and are not uploaded to the public repository.

#

# Keep data/raw/README.md so that the required filenames,

# worksheet names and directory structure remain documented.

# ==========================================================

data/raw/*
!data/raw/README.md

# The following files are therefore excluded automatically:

#

# data/raw/GSE220243_RAW/

# data/raw/proteomics/20240205-DAP.xlsx

# data/raw/proteomics/20240205-DIA-peptides.xlsx

# ==========================================================

# Processed data

#

# Large intermediate Seurat objects and other processed

# objects are not uploaded.

#

# Keep the README file that describes expected outputs.

# ==========================================================

data/processed/*
!data/processed/README.md

# ==========================================================

# Metadata

#

# Small public metadata tables in data/metadata/ are retained

# in the repository and are not ignored.

# ==========================================================

# ==========================================================

# Analysis results

#

# Small CSV or TXT result tables may be committed.

# Large high-resolution image files are excluded.

# PDF and PNG figures may be retained when they are useful

# for previewing or verifying the analysis.

# ==========================================================

results/figures/*.tif
results/figures/*.tiff

# ==========================================================

# Local configuration and private path files

# ==========================================================

config_local.R
paths_local.R
.env
.env.*

